### IMT: blank Notes (Transaction Description, field 2) — Mandatory, everything else valid.
### Expect: 200 OK, Success: false, Errors containing a "Notes" / "Transaction Description"
### blank-rejection reason tied to index 0.
POST {{baseUrl}}/convert
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "paymentTypeCode": "TT",
    "destinationBankAccountName": "SAMER MOHAMMED KIKI",
